# Minecraft Version(s): 26.3
## Changes:
- Added the Refuel enchantment for Elytras: each time a firework rocket is used while gliding, an identical rocket is taken from the inventory and added to the held stack; incompatible with Moonwalk
- The vanilla enchanted book trade of Novice Librarians now offers a vanilla enchantment 2 in 3 times and an Enchantments Encore enchantment 1 in 3 times
- Novice Librarians can now offer an extra enchanted book trade with an Enchantments Encore enchantment; which enchantments are available depends on the Librarian's villager type (Desert, Jungle, Plains, Savanna, Snowy, Swamp or Taiga)

## Fixes:
